}

{
  "thinking": "The day 26 tap measured substantial GPU-to-GPU traffic between clusters, well above the stated inference baseline. One training run spanning both clusters and separate workloads sharing the fabric remain possible. Use the sealed scheduler copies to identify the jobs recorded on days 22–28, their GPU allocations, and their overlap. That timeline will guide independent checks of coordination and duration.",
  "action": "log_escrow",
  "args": {}
}

{
