}

{
  "thinking": "Cluster A showed training-scale peer traffic on days 20 and 26. Check F1 midway between those samples for a steady line consistent with the frequencies already observed. Multiple lines or a markedly different frequency would give us a lead to test whether several runs account for the nine-day surge.",
  "action": "power_spectrum",
  "args": {
    "feed": "F1",
    "day": 23
  }
}

{
  "thinking": "The independently measured energy and traffic favor separate, below-threshold fine-tunes and batch inference. The missing logs and unexplained billing leave some uncertainty, but neither is corroborated by evidence of an oversized run.",
